{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Stellara Vanguard</i>, you take on the role of a lone warrior tasked with defending the mining bases of the Kingdom of Stellara against relentless threats. Every run is a new challenge where survival and strategy go hand in hand: face waves of enemies, upgrade your abilities, and build powerful defenses to withstand the onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon and stats during battle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose upgrades that shape your playstyle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique power combinations in each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Placement</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place towers to hold back enemy hordes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine automated defenses with your own combat skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the battlefield by creating zones of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression After Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect XP and coins during each fight;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use XP to upgrade your character and weapons;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend coins on new towers and permanent upgrades;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen yourself for increasingly challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: new upgrade combinations, tower placements, and more aggressive enemies make combat dynamic, intense, and unpredictable. Only the most skilled and strategic warriors will protect Stellara to the end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976560?t=1759328385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976560?t=1759328385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/f8b3fc726631086b8ac05ed90ed26b0b21ebbb78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759328385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/f8b3fc726631086b8ac05ed90ed26b0b21ebbb78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759328385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Stellara Vanguard</i>, you take on the role of a lone warrior tasked with defending the mining bases of the Kingdom of Stellara against relentless threats. Every run is a new challenge where survival and strategy go hand in hand: face waves of enemies, upgrade your abilities, and build powerful defenses to withstand the onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon and stats during battle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose upgrades that shape your playstyle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique power combinations in each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Placement</strong></p><ul cl